.TH "PBENCH" "1" "2026-11-12" "passerelle 0.1.0" "Passerelle host tools"
.SH NAME
pbench \- Passerelle measurements: roundtrips, workloads, comparative report
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pbench
.RI [ OPTION ]...
.I COMMAND
.RI [ COMMAND\-OPTION ]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Passerelle measurements: roundtrips, workloads, comparative report
.P
pbench runs the measurements of sections 7.5\-7.6 of the specification:
`roundtrips` counts the 9P roundtrips per POSIX call from a QEMU trace, the
workload subcommands measure throughput, metadata, tree walks, mixed load,
program launches and priority reads, `mount` measures the guest mount time,
`all` writes one JSON conformance file, and `report` aggregates runs into
Markdown, JSON and SVG and checks the section 7.6 thresholds.
